---
layout: layouts/base.njk
---
<section class="container home-intro">
  <h1 class="intro-name">Labidi Aymen</h1>
  <p class="intro-role">Solution architect &amp; dev manager — Tunisia</p>
  <div class="intro-prose">
    <p>
      I'm a self-taught engineer who has been building for the web since 2015 —
      through the Angular years, the JavaScript fatigue era, and a string of
      products for the Tunisian market. These days most of my time goes to
      running <a href="/ai/">AI&nbsp;agents in production</a> and writing here
      about what that actually takes, beyond the demo.
    </p>
    <p>
      The archive below goes back a decade. I've kept all of it — the old
      posts are a record of how we got here.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="container home-section">
  <h2 class="rule-heading">Writing</h2>
  {%- set posts = collections.posts | limit(10) %}
  {% include "post-list.njk" %}
  <p class="index-more"><a href="/blog/">Full index — {{ collections.posts.length }} posts →</a></p>
</section>

<section class="container home-section">
  <h2 class="rule-heading">Projects</h2>
  <ul class="project-index">
    {%- for post in collections.categoryMap | categoryPosts("projects") %}
    <li>
      <a href="{{ post.url }}">{{ post.data.title }}</a>
      <span class="project-desc">{{ post.templateContent | excerpt | truncate(90) }}</span>
    </li>
    {%- endfor %}
  </ul>
</section>
